<article class="env-lemma" id="00I4">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00I4">Lemma <span data-tag="00I4">10.45.6</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a perfect field. Any reduced $k$ algebra is geometrically reduced over $k$. Let $R$, $S$ be $k$-algebras. Assume both $R$ and $S$ are reduced. Then the $k$-algebra $R \otimes _ k S$ is reduced. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The first statement follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/030V" data-tag="030V">10.44.4</a>. For the second statement use the first statement and Lemma <a href="/tag/034N" data-tag="034N">10.43.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>